Domain Entity LeaveEvent
    documentation 'This event entity represents the recording of the dates of staff leave (e.g., 
                  'sick leave, personal time, vacation).
    date EventDate
        documentation 'Date for this leave event.
        is part of identity
    enumeration LeaveEventCategory
        documentation 'The code describing the type of leave taken, for example:
                      '
                      'Sick
                      '
                      'Personal
                      '
                      'Vacation.
        is part of identity
    string LeaveEventReason
        documentation 'Expanded reason for the staff leave.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 40
    decimal HoursOnLeave
        documentation 'The hours the staff was absent, if not the entire working day.
        is optional
        total digits 18
        decimal places 2
    bool SubstituteAssigned
        documentation 'Indicator of whether a substitute was assigned during the period of staff leave.
        is optional
    reference Staff
        documentation 'The staff associated with this leave event.
        is part of identity